{"id":"wb-5-314","name":"水西双塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"水西双塔","text":"水西双塔位于中国安徽省泾县城西2千米的水西白云山东南麓，地处青弋江西侧，有大观塔和小方塔两座楼阁式砖塔，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n大观塔又称崇宁塔，建于北宋大观二年（1108年），外观七层，内为十二层，高45米，底层与二层平面呈正方形，边长12米，三层以上为八边形。\n小方塔又称绍兴塔，建于南宋绍兴三十一年（1161年），高21.3米，七层，平面呈正方形，边长3.2米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E8%A5%BF%E5%8F%8C%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86542489,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86542489","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c03fc86396491fa145ea8352.jpg","title":"Jingxian_Daguan_Ta_2017.08.20_17-19-38.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jingxian_Daguan_Ta_2017.08.20_17-19-38.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Jingxian_Daguan_Ta_2017.08.20_17-19-38.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"泾县大观塔","width":320,"height":569}}